  "details": "So I have a dream to become a part of VRchat for however long it's up for, so I want a statue so everyone can remember me as someone who wanted to be “president of the world”. I know that this isn't what most people want, but I want to make an impact on the platform. The statue could represent the amount of time I've spent so I could fulfill my dream and the fact that I never gave up on doing my dreams. I've asked a bunch of people and spent hours just not to go anywhere. I just want everyone to have hope as I do, and I want people to follow their dreams so they don't give up on what they really want to do. That's all I have to say.",
